WHAT IS COVERED

Ekaterina Kuzmina is the author of the work in this repository: the BeCoMe library, the
FastAPI backend, the React application, the test suites, the documentation, the deployment
configuration and the tooling. She wrote it at the Faculty of Economics and Management,
Czech University of Life Sciences Prague. Two sets of files are exceptions, listed below.


THE METHOD THIS SOFTWARE IMPLEMENTS

The BeCoMe (Best-Compromise Mean) method is not the work of this author. Ivan Vrana,
Jan Tyrychtr and Martin Pelikan published it:

  Vrana, I., Tyrychtr, J., & Pelikan, M. (2021). BeCoMe: Easy-to-implement optimized
  method for best-compromise group decision making: Flood-prevention and COVID-19 case
  studies. Environmental Modelling & Software, 136, 104953.
  https://doi.org/10.1016/j.envsoft.2020.104953

Copyright covers expression rather than ideas, so the licence above applies to this source
code and makes no claim over the method, which anyone remains free to implement. What those
authors are owed is citation, and this file gives it.


