CASE-STUDY DATA AND REFERENCE VALUES

The three expert panels in examples/data/ (budget, floods, pendlers) and the expected
results in tests/reference/ originate from the method authors' own Excel workbook. This
repository reproduces them so the test suite can check its own results against theirs.
It matches to within 0.001 on every run. Credit for that data belongs to the method's
authors, not to this author.
